which is not itself a standalone License.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A LicenseAddition represents text which is intended to be added to a License
as additional text, but which is not itself intended to be a standalone
License.

It may be an exception which is listed on the
SPDX License Exceptions &lt;https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html&gt;
(ListedLicenseException), or may be any other additional text (as an exception
or otherwise) which is defined by an SPDX data creator (CustomLicenseAddition).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
