becomes applicable, or becomes valid.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A timestamp marking the commencement of an action,
the beginning of an element&#x27;s relevance,
or the intended start of either.

It encompasses the moment of triggering processes,
such as build executions or service instantiations,
as well as the point in time when an element
or a relationship between elements becomes effective or active.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
